meta {
  name: Public API
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  API Platform endpoints exposed under `/api`.

  Mostly public reads; write operations use a JWT bearer token — see `Login Check` to mint one
  into the `token` variable. These do **not** use the backoffice session cookie (that is the
  `Ajax legacy (write)` and `rz-admin` folders).
}
